<title>UK: Eridania sets 200 bln lire 7-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Eridania sets 200 bln lire 7-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers BCI, Credito Italiano and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ERIDANIA BEGHIN-SAY</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN ITL   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    18.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +25 BP    PAY DATE    18.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  100.10    FULL FEES   35 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB+	REOFFER    100	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS UK/FR/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
